  "details": "Description\n\nWhen I move my mouse diagonally, it jitters and shakes, even though I'm moving in a straight line. I tried everything Google says to make it stop, but it either doesn't work or makes it worse. \n\nReproduction Steps\n\nI don't know how this happened. It started happening after I left a world to join my friends and it didn't go away.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Performance\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.2p1-1902-20253ca7ae-Release\n\nunityVersion: 2022.3.22f2-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report",
